  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The proposed\r\nreplacement windows and the replacement of the door on the front elevation, by\r\nreason of their inferior and poor-quality materials and bulky design, design would\r\nresult in unacceptable harm to the significance of the locally listed heritage\r\nasset and to the character and appearance of Mount Park Estate Conservation Area and\r\nthe setting of the Sudbury Hill Conservation Area, for which there\r\nhas been no clear and convincing justification nor public benefits demonstrated\r\nwhich would outweigh this harm. The proposal is therefore contrary to the\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework Paragraphs 192 and 194 (2023), Policy HC1 of\r\nThe London Plan (2021), Policy CS1.D of the Harrow Core Strategy (2013) and\r\nPolicy DM7 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Plan (2013).&amp;nbsp;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
